{"id":"525bdca973e42a63","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-resolution-soundness-completeness.md","title":"归结的可靠性与反驳完备性","display":"thm-resolution-soundness-completeness — 归结的可靠性与反驳完备性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-resolution-soundness-completeness","aliases":["28-thm-resolution-soundness-completeness"],"display":"thm-resolution-soundness-completeness — 归结的可靠性与反驳完备性","depends_on":["[[28-df-resolution]]","[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]","[[28-df-boolean-formula]]"],"source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_printed_pages":"309–310,317","source_pdf_pages":"335–336,343"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-resolution-soundness-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-resolution-soundness-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-resolution-soundness-completeness — 归结的可靠性与反驳完备性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fced6234cc12ca5b\" href=\"?note=fced6234cc12ca5b\" title=\"28-df-resolution\">28-df-resolution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2eb3efc252f058f9\" href=\"?note=2eb3efc252f058f9\" title=\"28-df-boolean-evaluation\">28-df-boolean-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b830febc662345bf\" href=\"?note=b830febc662345bf\" title=\"28-df-boolean-formula\">28-df-boolean-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"309–310,317"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"335–336,343"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropVar}\">\\(\\mathrm{PropVar}\\)</span> 是命题变量集，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b830febc662345bf\" href=\"?note=b830febc662345bf\" title=\"28-df-boolean-formula\">28-df-boolean-formula</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathrm{CNF}\">\\(F\\in\\mathrm{CNF}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNFEval}_\\alpha\">\\(\\mathrm{CNFEval}_\\alpha\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2eb3efc252f058f9\" href=\"?note=2eb3efc252f058f9\" title=\"28-df-boolean-evaluation\">28-df-boolean-evaluation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ResRef}\">\\(\\operatorname{ResRef}\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fced6234cc12ca5b\" href=\"?note=fced6234cc12ca5b\" title=\"28-df-resolution\">28-df-resolution</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{ResRef}(F,\\pi)\\right)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\alpha:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\mathrm{CNFEval}_\\alpha(F)=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{ResRef}(F,\\pi)\\right)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\alpha:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\mathrm{CNFEval}_\\alpha(F)=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>可靠性：满足双亲的赋值必满足它们对枢轴的 resolvent，故满足全部输入子句者不可能满足空子句。完备性可按变量消去归纳：把含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的子句写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\lor C\">\\(x\\lor C\\)</span>、含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg x\">\\(\\neg x\\)</span> 的子句写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg x\\lor D\">\\(\\neg x\\lor D\\)</span>，保留不含枢轴的子句并加入所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\lor D\">\\(C\\lor D\\)</span>。若消去后有满足赋值，含正负枢轴的冲突会被某个 resolvent 排除，因而能扩展到原公式的满足赋值。故不可满足性保留，重复至零变量必出现空子句；每个新子句有原亲本，展开得有限归结反驳。此论证是有限 Davis–Putnam 消去；不要求另加弱化规则。已核对原书可靠/完备陈述，完备性在书中交给 Exercise 15.1。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§15.2，印刷 pp.309–310 / PDF pp.335–336；Exercise 15.1，印刷 p.317 / PDF p.343。已核对本项所述原文；集合/元组编码是本目录的显式实现约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-resolution","status":"resolved","id":"fced6234cc12ca5b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-resolution]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"2eb3efc252f058f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-formula","status":"resolved","id":"b830febc662345bf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-formula","status":"resolved","id":"b830febc662345bf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PropVar}$ 是命题变量集，see [[28-df-boolean-formula]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"2eb3efc252f058f9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F\\in\\mathrm{CNF}$，$\\mathrm{CNFEval}_\\alpha$ 来自 [[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]；$\\operatorname{ResRef}$ 来自 [[28-df-resolution]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-resolution","status":"resolved","id":"fced6234cc12ca5b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F\\in\\mathrm{CNF}$，$\\mathrm{CNFEval}_\\alpha$ 来自 [[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]；$\\operatorname{ResRef}$ 来自 [[28-df-resolution]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PropVar}","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathrm{CNF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CNFEval}_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ResRef}","display":false},{"tex":"\\left(\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{ResRef}(F,\\pi)\\right)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\alpha:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\mathrm{CNFEval}_\\alpha(F)=0.","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"x\\lor C","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg x","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg x\\lor D","display":false},{"tex":"C\\lor D","display":false}],"bytes":1934,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-220","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第15章：证明复杂性：[[28-df-propositional-proof-system]]、[[28-thm-polynomial-proofs-np-conp]]、[[28-df-resolution]]、[[28-thm-resolution-soundness-completeness]]、[[28-df-pigeonhole-cnf]]、[[28-thm-pigeonhole-resolution-lower-bound]]。"}],"outgoing":["fced6234cc12ca5b","2eb3efc252f058f9","b830febc662345bf"]}